---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Disclaimer" description="Legal disclaimer for MeshHub">
  <section class="max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6" data-i18n="disclaimer.title">Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="text-gray-400 space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
      <p data-i18n="disclaimer.p1">
        The information provided on MeshHub (quant-strategy.mesh-hub.xyz) is for research and
        educational purposes only. Nothing on this site constitutes investment
        advice, financial advice, trading advice, or any other sort of advice.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="disclaimer.p2">
        You should not treat any of the content on this site as such. MeshHub
        does not recommend that any cryptocurrency or financial instrument should
        be bought, sold, or held by you. Do your own due diligence and consult
        your financial advisor before making any investment decisions.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="disclaimer.p3">
        All trading strategies presented on this site are the result of
        automated quantitative research. Past performance is not indicative of
        future results. Trading cryptocurrencies involves substantial risk of
        loss and is not suitable for every investor.
      </p>
      <p data-i18n="disclaimer.p4">
        The strategy signals displayed on this site are generated automatically
        by open-source code running on GitHub Actions. While we strive for
        accuracy, we make no guarantees about the correctness, completeness, or
        timeliness of any information presented.
      </p>
      <p>
        MeshHub, its contributors, and maintainers shall not be held liable for
        any losses or damages arising from the use of information provided on
        this site.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold pt-4" data-i18n="disclaimer.data">Data Sources & Assumptions</h2>
      <p data-i18n="disclaimer.data_desc">
        Market data is sourced from OKX public API. Backtest results assume 0.1% trading fee per side. No slippage model is applied. Results may differ from actual trading performance.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm pt-4 border-t border-gray-800">
        By using this site, you acknowledge that you have read and understood
        this disclaimer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
